# Without this, `COPY . .` overwrites the alpine `npm ci` tree with the HOST's
# Windows node_modules and the build then runs a foreign tailwind binary.
# Railway is saved by .railwayignore; a plain `docker build .` is not - and this
# project adopted `docker build .` as the local proof after a lockfile incident
# where a passing `npm run build` did not mean a passing image.
node_modules
.git
.gitignore
e2e
*.log
